subproblem.statement:
Let P, n ∈ ℕ, H := μHE[n] on ℝ^P, U ⊆ ℝ^P open. For r ∈ ℕ let:
- M_r ⊆ U be H-null-measurable;
- θ_r : ℝ^P → ℝ be H-integrable on M_r ∩ K for every compact K ⊆ U, with θ_r ≥ 1 on M_r;
- c_r ∈ ℤ;
such that Σ'_r |c_r|·∫⁻_{M_r ∩ W} ofReal θ_r dH < ∞ for every open W ⊂⊂ U (CompactlyContainedOpen W U). Let Θ(x) := Σ'_r |c_r|·1_{M_r}(x)·ofReal θ_r(x) ∈ [0, ∞]. Then:
(a) ∫⁻_K Θ dH < ∞ for every compact K ⊆ U;
(b) for H-a.e. x ∈ ℝ^P the set {r : c_r ≠ 0 and x ∈ M_r} is finite.

